WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.564 --> 00:00:06.263
nthstock: paper trading on a simulated NSE market. Tap Try demo.

2
00:00:06.263 --> 00:00:09.122
One tap from the login page to a live chart. The "Simulated" panel moves the price.

3
00:00:09.122 --> 00:00:12.104
US-01 · Tap the price axis: a ghost order line appears. Nothing is sent yet.

4
00:00:12.104 --> 00:00:16.039
Drag the line by its handle to the price you want. The chart does not pan.

5
00:00:16.039 --> 00:00:19.529
US-02 · Tap Buy: the ticket opens at the line price. Add a 1% trailing stop.

6
00:00:19.529 --> 00:00:24.833
Quantity 4, trail 1%. The preview line says what will happen on the fill.

7
00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:27.646
Filled. The position chip shows live P&L; the amber line is the trailing stop.

8
00:00:27.646 --> 00:00:29.759
US-03 · Tap the position: its trailing-stop sheet opens.

9
00:00:29.759 --> 00:00:32.864
Change the trail to 1.5% and update. One modify, no cancel and replace.

10
00:00:32.864 --> 00:00:38.852
US-04 · Rally the price: the stop follows new highs.

11
00:00:38.852 --> 00:00:41.271
The stop moved up from ₹1,348.75 to ₹1,365.55.

12
00:00:41.271 --> 00:00:44.944
Pull back: the stop never moves down.

13
00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:47.191
Gap down 3% through the stop: it triggers once and sells the 4 shares.

14
00:00:47.191 --> 00:00:49.800
Trailing stop triggered. Position and line are gone.

15
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:57.358
US-05 · Scalp mode: pick a size, arm, then one tap in and one tap out.

16
00:00:57.358 --> 00:01:04.094
Bought 5 at the ask. The strip shows the open position.

17
00:01:04.094 --> 00:01:07.207
Flatten: closed in one tap. Trading is only live while armed.

18
00:01:07.207 --> 00:01:10.418
Every surface reads one engine state: chart, ticket, depth and strip never disagree.
